{
  "comment": "v2.2.9 Phase 5 (T010) -- dual-asserted golden card pills (WN-7 discipline). Both nexus_installer.pages.typed_catalog.derive_fact_pills (Qt) and desktop/src/shared/models/modelPills.buildModelPills (React) must produce exactly these strings, in this order, for each case. Derivation is locked: Company from FAMILY_TO_PUBLISHER (omit unmapped/Community), Country from origin, Agentic Yes/No on LLM rows only, Context window from contextWindowIn/contextWindow, Multimodal from modalities-beyond-text or vision, Guardrails from the uncensored tri-state (false -> Censored, true -> Uncensored, missing -> omitted), License verbatim, Released as en-US Month YYYY (ASCII). A pill with a missing source value is omitted -- never Unknown, never an invented Community.",
